	Well I've got my AC to -28, hp at 225, +7 Excalibur and a few 
tidbits to save my tush from obliteration.  I'm going for the wizard, but
before I go I'll pass a cheat or two along.

	After trying to decide which character class to play, priest:
identify & praying  vs  wizard LOTS of neat stuff to start, I got a wizard
going but with pitiful stats and hit points.  I deliberately piled everything
I could find on a lawful altar and went and offered myself to the ravenous 
beasts.  I wasn't sure it would work but a few characters later I stumbled
upon _the_ bones level and set about IDing everything, including my most
prized possession- a ring of protection +7! This got my character equipped
to handle the next stages of the dungeon.  Other than that I have made it
with one wand of wishing (4 wishes) and a grateful djinni (wand of polymorph).
Only 4 shops (small ones), potions, general, weapons (worthless), armor 
(shield of reflection). No temples! I have gold stashed everywhere, but
nothing to do with it.  I have piles of gems, thanks to polypiling, and
grateful unicorns everywhere.  

	Well, wish Jeremiah luck!

